From: Alex <291639929+alexdev3372@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:42:29 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] nvn: support bounded overlapping linear texture rows

Keep the current sparse writeback path and exercise retirement of both timestamp report types, whose production fix is already upstream.

Upstream-Status: pending
Reason: Short-pitch textures abort Skyrim New Game.
Issue: seedds/nxnative#148
---
